  "legalUpdated": "Last updated: August 2026",
  "privacyH1": "What we collect",
  "privacyP1": "An account needs an email address and a name. If you list a property, we store what you write about it: location, price, specifications and descriptions. Search text is kept to improve how requests are read, and is not tied to your account.",
  "privacyH2": "What we do not collect",
  "privacyP2": "We do not ask for national ID numbers, banking details or your physical location. We run no advertising, we do not sell your data, and we do not share it with ad brokers.",
  "privacyH3": "Links to other portals",
  "privacyP3": "When you open a result from another Jordanian portal, you leave for their site. From that moment their privacy policy applies, not ours, and we do not tell them who was searching.",
  "privacyH4": "Your rights",
  "privacyP4": "You can edit or delete any listing from your dashboard at any time, and deleting removes it from our database. To request full account deletion, write to privacy@akarat.ai.",
  "termsH1": "Using the platform",
  "termsP1": "Searching is open to everyone. Listing a property requires an account, and you are responsible for what is published under it. Do not list a property you have no right to market. Nothing unlawful, discriminatory, offensive or abusive, in a listing or an enquiry: we remove it, and may close the account that posted it. Anyone can report a listing from its page.",
  "termsH2": "Listing accuracy",
  "termsP2": "What you write is what gets shown. Listing a property at a price, size or location that is not real is reason enough to remove it without notice.",
  "termsH3": "External results",
  "termsP3": "Results from other portals are what those portals published. We show them as they are, with a link to the source. We do not guarantee those properties are still available or correctly priced, and we take no commission on any deal.",
  "termsH4": "Liability",
  "termsP4": "Akarat is a search and listing tool, not a broker or an agent. View the property and verify ownership before any payment. Any agreement stays between you and the other party."
